Hello! A small patch has been released to fix some issues. Check out the list of improvements:  

- Fixed FPS rate;  
- Fixed counterattack text;  
- Fixed counterattack conditions for the "Trap," "Electrified," and "Tangled" abilities;  
- Fixed typos and grammar mistakes;  
- Fixed minor visual bugs;  
- Added automatic fullscreen on game launch;  
- Fixed a softlock in the opening cutscene.  

Thank you for your support of the game!
